---------------

| Address | Register    | Access Type | Contents                           |
|---------|-------------|-------------|------------------------------------|
| 0x00    | CTRL_STATUS | RW/RO       | [31:16] STATUS, [15:0] CONTROL     |
| 0x04    | KEY0        | RW          | Key [127:96]                       |
| 0x08    | KEY1        | RW          | Key [95:64]                        |
| 0x0C    | KEY2        | RW          | Key [63:32]                        |
| 0x10    | KEY3        | RW          | Key [31:0]                         |
| 0x14    | TEXT0       | RW          | Plaintext [127:96]                 |
| 0x18    | TEXT1       | RW          | Plaintext [95:64]                  |
| 0x1C    | TEXT2       | RW          | Plaintext [63:32]                  |
| 0x20    | TEXT3       | RW          | Plaintext [31:0]                   |
